    "extraction_notes": [
      "PDF SHA-256 verified as 906d1c365862c39406c021999b5939ae4d25cabd87a47ece7d342b8af081dd4e.",
      "The datasheet identifies the device as an NPN transistor and states TA = 25 degC unless otherwise specified for the maximum ratings, electrical characteristics, and curves.",
      "Figures 1 through 4 on p. 2 were inspected; plotted points included here are direct graph read-offs only, with no interpolation between points.",
      "The hFE table provides minimum values at IC = 1 mA and 100 mA and minimum plus maximum values at IC = 10 mA; these bounds are preserved separately from digitized typical curve values.",
      "The datasheet provides one tabulated VCE(sat)/VBE(sat) condition at IC = 10 mA and IB = 1 mA; additional saturation points are digitized typical values from the beta = 10 curves on p. 2.",
      "Cibo, Early-voltage data, and a separate input-capacitance row are not published in the supplied datasheet and are represented as null or omitted by the strict schema.",
      "The datasheet also lists V(BR)CBO = 180 V minimum and V(BR)EBO = 6.0 V minimum at TA = 25 degC, but the strict BJT schema has no fields for those limits."
